<font color="#ffffff">Mm-hm. Sure.</font>

183
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">Officer.</font>

184
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:14,640
<font color="#ffffff">He'll take you to Dillon.</font>

185
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:17,360
<font color="#00ffff">Thank you.</font>

186
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:28,800
<font color="#ffffff">Disgusting.</font>

187
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,120
<font color="#ffffff">Beer?</font>

188
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,880
<font color="#ffff00">Sure.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Mehmet?</font>

189
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:41,920
<font color="#00ffff">No, thank you. They're going to be</font>
<font color="#00ffff">wondering where I am.</font>

190
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:45,760
<font color="#ffffff">There must be some glasses</font>
<font color="#ffffff">around here somewhere.</font>

191
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,840
