192
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">These photos in London,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I look so happy.</font>

193
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,440
<font color="#ffffff">Why did I come here?</font>

194
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,400
<font color="#00ffff">Your career.</font>

195
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:10,720
<font color="#00ffff">You were having a hard time</font>
<font color="#00ffff">establishing yourself in London.</font>

196
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:13,560
<font color="#00ffff">Thought Istanbul might give you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">better opportunities.</font>

197
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,640
