198
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:23,480
<font color="#00ffff">It was hard, but...</font>

199
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:25,080
<font color="#00ffff">..I understood.</font>

200
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:35,120
<font color="#00ffff">Look, I need to get back to work.</font>

201
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,840
<font color="#ffffff">Right, yeah.</font>

202
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:42,160
<font color="#00ffff">So what haven't we covered?</font>

203
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:44,160
