224
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,480
<font color="#ffffff">Here.</font>

225
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,080
<font color="#00ff00">What happened to you?</font>

226
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:02,760
<font color="#00ffff">I got Istanbuled.</font>

227
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:04,720
<font color="#00ffff">Got my foot run over by a motorbike</font>

228
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:07,200
