00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">We need to talk about Demir's death.</font>

268
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:42,440
<font color="#ffffff">Demir was murdered...</font>

269
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">..because he presented</font>
<font color="#ffffff">an obstacle to Erol Bey.</font>

270
00:21:48,800 --> 00:21:52,920
<font color="#ffffff">I think the murderer</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is after your family's fortune.</font>

271
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:57,320
<font color="#ffffff">And sadly, we suspected</font>
