310
00:26:08,320 --> 00:26:10,320
<font color="#00ffff">..to pay a boy called Muzo</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to kill Demir.</font>

311
00:26:13,040 --> 00:26:15,160
<font color="#00ff00">No.</font><font color="#ffff00"> No?</font><font color="#00ff00"> No, I didn't.</font>

312
00:26:17,120 --> 00:26:19,080
<font color="#00ff00">This is the evidence against me?</font>

313
00:26:19,080 --> 00:26:22,000
<font color="#00ff00">Do you have my fingerprints</font>
<font color="#00ff00">on Muzo's money?</font>

314
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:24,200
