315
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:26,840
<font color="#00ff00">So what if I was there</font>
<font color="#00ff00">on the 22nd of March?</font>

316
00:26:26,840 --> 00:26:28,240
<font color="#00ff00">I'm a regular client.</font>

317
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:33,400
<font color="#00ffff">Erol just gives you these items to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">sell and lets you pocket the money?</font>

318
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:36,040
<font color="#00ffff">I don't know, doesn't seem likely.</font>

319
00:26:36,040 --> 00:26:37,960
<font color="#00ff00">Do you really think Erol wouldn't</font>
<font color="#00ff00">find out</font>

