337
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:38,520
<font color="#00ff00">And I'll tell you the most valuable</font>
<font color="#00ff00">thing he's always allowed me.</font>

338
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:41,680
<font color="#00ff00">Dignity.</font>

339
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:48,560
<font color="#00ffff">Don't buy it. He stole those things.</font>

340
00:27:48,560 --> 00:27:52,440
<font color="#ffffff">Unfortunately,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Erol Karagul is in no state</font>

341
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:55,040
<font color="#ffffff">to confirm or deny Cem's story.</font>

342
00:27:55,040 --> 00:27:56,960
<font color="#00ffff">Yeah, and he knows that.</font>

343
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:58,240
<font color="#ffff00">Wait, wait.</font>

344
00:27:58,240 --> 00:28:00,840
<font color="#ffff00">OK, this is</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the auction house catalogue.</font>

345
00:28:00,840 --> 00:28:04,160
<font color="#ffff00">Two 1920s antique watches</font>
