346
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:06,240
<font color="#ffff00">Cem was there at 10am.</font>

347
00:28:06,240 --> 00:28:08,240
<font color="#ffff00">No trace of him in the afternoon.</font>

348
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,640
<font color="#00ffff">OK, so what do we do now?</font>

349
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">Let him go.</font><font color="#00ffff"> No way, no.</font>

350
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">Without the link to Muzo's money,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we have nothing against him.</font>

351
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:18,920
<font color="#ffffff">Which is why, when we release him,</font>
